---
import Eyebrow from "./Eyebrow.astro";
import Card from "./Card.astro";
---

<section
  class="mx-auto flex w-full max-w-page flex-col gap-stack px-gutter pt-section"
>
  <Eyebrow>Local by construction</Eyebrow>

  <h2 class="max-w-[700px] font-display text-h2">
    None of it leaves your machine.
  </h2>

  <div class="mt-[22px] grid grid-cols-1 gap-cards lg:grid-cols-3">
    <Card title="No account">
      Nothing to sign up for and nothing to sign in to. GitWarren is one
      person&#39;s app, on one machine, with no notion of anybody else.
    </Card>
    <Card title="Nothing cached">
      Every branch name, commit and diff on screen is read from git at the moment
      it is shown &mdash; so nothing can quietly go stale behind your back.
    </Card>
    <Card title="One SQLite file">
      Your reviews and comments live in a single file in your application-data
      directory. Delete it and GitWarren is gone. Your repositories are
      untouched.
    </Card>
  </div>
</section>
